Need to master good project management and presentation skills to support team leader in delivering professional technical submissions;
Strong problem solving skills and negotiation skills;
Ability to undertake interdisciplinary technical work and able to work under pressure in a fast work environment;
Excellent skills in written and verbal communication (Chinese and English).
